# --demo and --followup E002 run offline; no credentials are required.
# --generate-hypotheses reuses OpenCode's existing provider credentials.
# The Codex backend also reuses this key via a child-only environment variable;
# global Codex auth.json and ChatGPT login are not changed.
# Optional when the executable is not discoverable:
# SCIENTIST_OPENCODE_BIN=/absolute/path/to/opencode
# This application does not load .env automatically; export the variable.
